{
  "id": "r-technique-factor-analysis",
  "term": "R-technique factor analysis",
  "definition": "R-technique factor analysis is a factor-analytic approach used with data from many people, often from a one-time or cross-sectional assessment, to identify the common factor structure across individuals. It reflects a nomothetic, group-level pattern rather than a person-specific one.",
